{"seq":91,"slug":"efficient-attention-mechanisms","title":"高效注意力机制","stage":"DONE","category":"ai-llm","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/efficient-attention-mechanisms","rating":{"composite":4.1,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"高效注意力机制\">高效注意力机制</h1><p>自注意力是 Transformer 的心脏，也是它最贵的器官。一段长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 的序列里，每个 token 都要与其余所有 token 算一遍相关性，于是计算量和显存随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 膨胀。把上下文从 4K 拉到 128K，朴素注意力的代价不是涨 32 倍，而是涨 1000 倍。这个二次墙决定了今天几乎所有「长上下文」「低延迟推理」「端侧部署」难题的下界，而本 hub 讲的，就是人们如何绕开、压低、或重写这堵墙。</p>\n<p>整个 hub 由四条递进的主线串成。<strong>基础</strong>章先把问题摆清楚：注意力到底贵在哪、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的计算与显存各占多少、为什么显存往往比算力更早撞墙，并给出一张「高效注意力谱系图」，把后面所有方法归位。<strong>稀疏与线性</strong>章是「改算法」的两大流派——稀疏注意力让每个 token 只看一部分邻居（局部、块、可学习的动态稀疏），把矩阵打孔变稀；线性注意力则换掉 softmax、利用矩阵乘法结合律把复杂度压到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，并与状态空间模型殊途同归；低秩与核方法则用可证明误差的近似去逼近那张稠密注意力矩阵。<strong>IO 感知</strong>章是「不改算法、改实现」的流派——FlashAttention 不再把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N\\times N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 矩阵写回显存，靠分块与在线 softmax 把瓶颈从算力转到访存；分块与重计算把这一思路推广到反向传播与多卡并行；分页注意力则在推理解码阶段像操作系统管理虚拟内存一样管理 KV 缓存。<strong>实践</strong>章收口：长度外推让短训模型跑长序列，选型权衡给出「什么场景该用哪一类」的决策框架，落地与边界谈工程库、混合架构与方法的失效边界。</p>\n<p>四条线的关系是：稀疏/线性/低秩动的是<strong>数学复杂度</strong>，IO 感知动的是<strong>硬件访存</strong>，二者正交、常常叠加使用（例如 FlashAttention 之上再叠稀疏掩码）；而实践章告诉你如何在真实负载里组合它们。</p>\n<p><strong>与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</strong>（务必先认清，避免误入）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>本 hub 只讲<strong>注意力这一层</strong>如何变高效。Transformer 整体架构、自注意力的原始定义与训练，属于 LLM 基础类 hub，本 hub 默认你已懂 QKV 与多头注意力。</li>\n<li><strong>状态空间模型（60_state-space-models-mamba）</strong>：Mamba/S4/SSM 是「彻底不用注意力」的另一条序列建模路线。线性注意力与 SSM 在数学上高度同构，本 hub 在线性注意力篇点到这种同构并链接过去，但 SSM 的离散化、选择性扫描、硬件并行扫描等本体内容不在此展开。</li>\n<li><strong>KV 缓存优化（71_kv-cache-optimization）</strong>：KV 缓存的量化、驱逐、前缀共享、跨请求复用是「缓存」这一资源的优化，属于推理系统层。本 hub 的分页注意力篇只讲注意力 kernel 如何消费分页后的 KV，缓存本身的管理细节链接到 71。</li>\n<li><strong>长上下文技术（62_long-context-llm-techniques）</strong>：62 从「如何把上下文做长」的系统视角组织（评测、context rot、百万 token 工程）；本 hub 从「注意力机制本身」的视角组织。位置编码外推、稀疏局部注意力两处会与 62 交叠，本 hub 讲机制原理，62 讲长上下文工程落地，互相链接不重复。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>推荐学习路径</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>只想建立直觉的读者：基础章三篇 → 实践章「选型权衡」即可，中间方法章按需查阅。</li>\n<li>做推理/部署的工程师：基础章 →「IO 感知」整章 → 实践章「落地与边界」，这是降延迟省显存的主干。</li>\n<li>做模型架构/研究的读者：基础章 →「稀疏与线性」整章 →「IO 感知」的分块与重计算 → 实践章「选型权衡」，关注复杂度与质量的取舍前沿。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>前置知识</strong>：理解 Transformer 自注意力的 QKV 计算与多头机制、softmax、矩阵乘法的 FLOPs 与显存账、GPU 的 HBM/SRAM 存储层级的基本概念。具备这些后，本 hub 可以独立读完。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/efficient-attention-mechanisms/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-attention-expensive","title":"为何注意力昂贵","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/efficient-attention-mechanisms/foundations/why-attention-expensive"},{"seq":2,"slug":"complexity-bottleneck","title":"二次复杂度瓶颈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/efficient-attention-mechanisms/foundations/complexity-bottleneck"},{"seq":3,"slug":"efficient-attention-taxonomy","title":"高效注意力谱系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/efficient-attention-mechanisms/foundations/efficient-attention-taxonomy"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"sparse-linear","title":"稀疏与线性","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/efficient-attention-mechanisms/sparse-linear","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sparse-attention","title":"稀疏注意力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/efficient-attention-mechanisms/sparse-linear/sparse-attention"},{"seq":2,"slug":"linear-attention","title":"线性注意力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/efficient-attention-mechanisms/sparse-linear/linear-attention"},{"seq":3,"slug":"low-rank-kernel","title":"低秩与核方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/efficient-attention-mechanisms/sparse-linear/low-rank-kernel"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"io-aware","title":"IO 感知","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/efficient-attention-mechanisms/io-aware","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"flash-attention","title":"FlashAttention IO 感知","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/efficient-attention-mechanisms/io-aware/flash-attention"},{"seq":2,"slug":"blockwise-recompute","title":"分块与重计算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/efficient-attention-mechanisms/io-aware/blockwise-recompute"},{"seq":3,"slug":"paged-attention","title":"分页注意力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/efficient-attention-mechanisms/io-aware/paged-attention"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/efficient-attention-mechanisms/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"length-extrapolation","title":"长度外推","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/efficient-attention-mechanisms/practice/length-extrapolation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"attention-selection","title":"选型权衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/efficient-attention-mechanisms/practice/attention-selection"},{"seq":3,"slug":"efficient-attention-in-practice","title":"落地与边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/efficient-attention-mechanisms/practice/efficient-attention-in-practice"}]}]}